WEBVTT

00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:05.800
You enter data and instruction into the computer using input devices.

00:00:06.150 --> 00:00:11.975
The data and instructions are stored inside the computer in some storage devices.

00:00:12.325 --> 00:00:16.800
Primary memory and secondary memory are the two types of memory.

00:00:17.150 --> 00:00:24.425
Some commonly used secondary devices are Hard disk, Pen drive, DVD, CD, etc.

00:00:24.775 --> 00:00:29.125
Primary memory is of two types- RAM and ROM.

00:00:29.475 --> 00:00:33.850
The data stored on the computers is handled in terms of bits.
